        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4622, Traditional Urn Tip Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by RK International, this traditionally styled pull can be used in a variety of applications including on front doors and as an appliance pull. Beautiful in its classic design, the  Urn Tip Door Handle features decorative ends that add a lovely detail to an already lovely door pull. It is available in 7 finishes. Choose fro 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/plain-pull-with-decorative-ends-rk-international-cp-815\"><b>Urn Tip Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Plain Door Pull with Decorative Ends:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4622:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4623:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 21-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
